{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-33348","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37907","text":"ADR-0005: Deployment Immutability + Active Deployment Pointer Model"}]},{"id":"blk-33349","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33351","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37908","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-37909","text":" Accepted (v1)"}]}],"id":"blk-33350","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37910","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-37911","text":" 2026-01-21"}]}],"id":"blk-33352","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33355","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37912","marks":["bold"],"text":"Owners:"},{"id":"spn-37913","text":" webhost.systems engineering"}]}],"id":"blk-33354","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33357","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37914","marks":["bold"],"text":"Related docs:"}]}],"id":"blk-33356","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33359","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37915","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/00_MASTER_SPEC.md"}]}],"id":"blk-33358","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33361","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37916","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/10_API_CONTRACTS.md"}]}],"id":"blk-33360","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33363","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37917","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-33362","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33365","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37918","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/30_DATA_MODEL_CONVEX.md"}]}],"id":"blk-33364","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33367","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37919","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/60_TESTING_ACCEPTANCE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-33366","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33368","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37920","text":"1) Context"}]},{"id":"blk-33369","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37921","text":"webhost.systems deploys untrusted customer agent code to one of multiple runtime providers and routes invocations to the correct deployed version. The platform must support:"}]},{"id":"blk-33370","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37922","text":"safe, repeatable deployments,"}]}],"id":"blk-33371","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37923","text":"rapid iteration with reliable rollbacks,"}]}],"id":"blk-33373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37924","text":"clear auditability (“what is running now, and who changed it?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-33375","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37925","text":"consistent routing across multiple runtime providers,"}]}],"id":"blk-33377","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33380","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37926","text":"robust handling of partial failures (deploy succeeded on provider but DB update failed; or vice versa),"}]}],"id":"blk-33379","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37927","text":"deterministic metering attribution to "},{"id":"spn-37928","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId, runtimeProvider}"},{"id":"spn-37929","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33381","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33383","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37930","text":"Early prototypes often store deployment state “in place” on the agent record (e.g., overwriting "},{"id":"spn-37931","marks":["code"],"text":"workerUrl"},{"id":"spn-37932","text":", updating "},{"id":"spn-37933","marks":["code"],"text":"codeHash"},{"id":"spn-37934","text":", etc.). This tends to create correctness and support problems:"}]},{"id":"blk-33384","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37935","text":"You lose historical context (“what changed?”)."}]}],"id":"blk-33385","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33388","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37936","text":"Rollback is difficult or impossible without redeploying."}]}],"id":"blk-33387","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37937","text":"In-flight deploys can corrupt the “current” state if they fail midway."}]}],"id":"blk-33389","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37938","text":"Auditing, debugging, and cost reconciliation become fragile."}]}],"id":"blk-33391","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37939","text":"Concurrency introduces race conditions: two deploys can interleave and leave the agent in an inconsistent state."}]}],"id":"blk-33393","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37940","text":"Therefore, the system needs a durable, auditable, and concurrency-tolerant model for deployments and routing."}]},{"id":"blk-33396","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37941","text":"2) Decision"}]},{"id":"blk-33397","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37942","text":"2.1 Deployment immutability"}]},{"id":"blk-33398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37943","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-37944","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deployment"},{"id":"spn-37945","text":" is an immutable record representing a specific released version of an agent."}]},{"id":"blk-33399","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37946","text":"A new deployment attempt MUST create a "},{"id":"spn-37947","marks":["bold"],"text":"new deployment record"},{"id":"spn-37948","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-37949","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-37950","text":" table row)."}]}],"id":"blk-33400","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37951","text":"Deployment records MUST be treated as immutable after creation, except for a narrowly defined mutable subset:"}]}],"id":"blk-33402","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33405","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37952","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-37953","text":" (e.g., deploying → active/failed)"}]}],"id":"blk-33404","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33407","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37954","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef"},{"id":"spn-37955","text":" (filled once known)"}]}],"id":"blk-33406","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33409","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37956","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"},{"id":"spn-37957","text":" (sanitized)"}]}],"id":"blk-33408","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37958","text":"timestamps like "},{"id":"spn-37959","marks":["code"],"text":"deployedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-37960","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-37961","marks":["code"],"text":"finishedAtMs"}]}],"id":"blk-33410","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33413","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37962","text":"optional "},{"id":"spn-37963","marks":["code"],"text":"logsRef"},{"id":"spn-37964","text":" pointer"}]}],"id":"blk-33412","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33415","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37965","text":"Any new code/artifact/provider configuration change MUST create a new deployment record (never modify an existing deployment to “become” the new version)."}]}],"id":"blk-33414","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33416","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37966","text":"2.2 Active deployment pointer"}]},{"id":"blk-33417","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37967","text":"Each agent has a single routing pointer:"}]},{"id":"blk-33418","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37968","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-37969","text":" points to the deployment that should receive invocations."}]}],"id":"blk-33419","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37970","text":"Rollback (and “activate old deployment”) is implemented by updating "},{"id":"spn-37971","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-37972","text":" to a previous deployment id."}]}],"id":"blk-33421","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37973","text":"Invocation routing uses ONLY:"}]}],"id":"blk-33423","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33426","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37974","text":"agent ownership checks + status checks, then"}]}],"id":"blk-33425","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37975","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-37976","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-37977","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.providerRef"},{"id":"spn-37978","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-37979","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-37980","text":" to select runtime adapter and invoke."}]}],"id":"blk-33427","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33429","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37981","text":"2.3 Single-writer rule per agent during deploy (v1 simplification)"}]},{"id":"blk-33430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37982","text":"To reduce complexity and prevent version races in v1:"}]},{"id":"blk-33431","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33433","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37983","text":"The platform MUST prevent concurrent deployments per agent (e.g., guard with "},{"id":"spn-37984","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.status=deploying"},{"id":"spn-37985","text":" or a server-side mutex mechanism)."}]}],"id":"blk-33432","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33435","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37986","text":"A second deploy attempt while "},{"id":"spn-37987","marks":["code"],"text":"deploying"},{"id":"spn-37988","text":" SHOULD fail with "},{"id":"spn-37989","marks":["code"],"text":"CONFLICT"},{"id":"spn-37990","text":" (or be queued post-v1)."}]}],"id":"blk-33434","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33436","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37991","text":"3) Rationale"}]},{"id":"blk-33437","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37992","text":"3.1 Safety and correctness"}]},{"id":"blk-33438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37993","text":"Immutability avoids a class of “torn writes” where partial updates leave the system in an inconsistent state. If deployment artifacts and references are immutable, you can always answer:"}]},{"id":"blk-33439","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37994","text":"exactly what was deployed,"}]}],"id":"blk-33440","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37995","text":"where it was deployed,"}]}],"id":"blk-33442","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33445","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37996","text":"and when it changed."}]}],"id":"blk-33444","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33446","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37997","text":"3.2 Rollbacks become fast and reliable"}]},{"id":"blk-33447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37998","text":"With immutable deployments, rollback is primarily a pointer change:"}]},{"id":"blk-33448","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37999","text":"no redeploy required (unless provider forces it for technical reasons),"}]}],"id":"blk-33449","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38000","text":"quick recovery from bad deploys,"}]}],"id":"blk-33451","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38001","text":"repeatable and auditable."}]}],"id":"blk-33453","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33455","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38002","text":"3.3 Auditing and supportability"}]},{"id":"blk-33456","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38003","text":"A permanent deployment history supports:"}]},{"id":"blk-33457","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38004","text":"customer support (“what changed?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-33458","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38005","text":"incident response (“who activated what?”),"}]}],"id":"blk-33460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38006","text":"compliance-aligned audits."}]}],"id":"blk-33462","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33464","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38007","text":"3.4 Metering attribution and future cost reconciliation"}]},{"id":"blk-33465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38008","text":"When telemetry references a "},{"id":"spn-38009","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38010","text":" and deployments are immutable, usage can always be attributed to an exact version and provider resource set. This also enables future provider cost reconciliation by tagging provider resources per deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-33466","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38011","text":"3.5 Multi-runtime routing simplicity"}]},{"id":"blk-33467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38012","text":"A single "},{"id":"spn-38013","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38014","text":" model works uniformly across providers:"}]},{"id":"blk-33468","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38015","text":"Cloudflare: "},{"id":"spn-38016","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef.cloudflare.workerUrl"},{"id":"spn-38017","text":" etc."}]}],"id":"blk-33469","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33472","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38018","text":"AgentCore: "},{"id":"spn-38019","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef.agentcore.agentRuntimeArn"},{"id":"spn-38020","text":" etc."}]}],"id":"blk-33471","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38021","text":"The control plane remains provider-agnostic; provider-specific details are confined to adapter implementations."}]},{"id":"blk-33474","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38022","text":"4) Alternatives considered"}]},{"id":"blk-33475","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38023","text":"A) Mutable deployment state stored on the agent row only"}]},{"id":"blk-33476","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38024","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33477","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33479","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38025","text":"Minimal schema."}]}],"id":"blk-33478","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38026","text":"Simplifies “what’s currently active” (single record)."}]}],"id":"blk-33480","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33482","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38027","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33483","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33485","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38028","text":"Loses history."}]}],"id":"blk-33484","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33487","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38029","text":"Hard to rollback."}]}],"id":"blk-33486","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33489","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38030","text":"Partial failures can corrupt the running pointer."}]}],"id":"blk-33488","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33491","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38031","text":"Difficult to audit and debug."}]}],"id":"blk-33490","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33493","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38032","text":"Makes telemetry attribution ambiguous when “current deployment” changes."}]}],"id":"blk-33492","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38033","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-38034","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-33495","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38035","text":"B) Immutable deployments without an active pointer (derive “active” from latest successful deploy)"}]},{"id":"blk-33496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38036","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33497","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33499","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38037","text":"No pointer updates; “active” is last successful deployment."}]}],"id":"blk-33498","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38038","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33501","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33503","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38039","text":"Rollback becomes non-trivial (must “fake” a new deploy or add flags)."}]}],"id":"blk-33502","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33505","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38040","text":"“Latest” is not always what you want running (e.g., canary, manual pinning)."}]}],"id":"blk-33504","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38041","text":"In-flight deploys complicate “latest success” semantics."}]}],"id":"blk-33506","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38042","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-38043","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-33509","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38044","text":"C) Mutable “active deployment” record plus separate immutable history"}]},{"id":"blk-33510","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38045","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33511","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38046","text":"A dedicated active record could simplify reads."}]}],"id":"blk-33512","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33514","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38047","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33515","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33517","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38048","text":"You now have two sources of truth to keep consistent."}]}],"id":"blk-33516","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33519","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38049","text":"Reintroduces mutability issues for the “active” record."}]}],"id":"blk-33518","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33521","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38050","text":"Added complexity with limited benefit over a pointer."}]}],"id":"blk-33520","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38051","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-38052","text":" Rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-33523","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38053","text":"D) Blue/green or canary routing model as default"}]},{"id":"blk-33524","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38054","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33525","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33527","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38055","text":"Advanced rollout safety."}]}],"id":"blk-33526","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38056","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33529","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33531","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38057","text":"Too complex for v1."}]}],"id":"blk-33530","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38058","text":"Requires traffic splitting, per-request routing policies, and richer metrics gating."}]}],"id":"blk-33532","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38059","text":"Still requires immutable deployments underneath."}]}],"id":"blk-33534","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33536","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38060","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision:"},{"id":"spn-38061","text":" Deferred to post-v1; can be built on top of this ADR."}]},{"id":"blk-33537","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38062","text":"5) Consequences"}]},{"id":"blk-33538","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38063","text":"5.1 Positive consequences"}]},{"id":"blk-33539","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33541","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38064","text":"Reliable rollback (pointer flip)."}]}],"id":"blk-33540","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38065","text":"Clear deployment audit trail."}]}],"id":"blk-33542","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33545","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38066","text":"Strong basis for incident response and debugging."}]}],"id":"blk-33544","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38067","text":"Simplified multi-runtime invocation routing."}]}],"id":"blk-33546","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33549","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38068","text":"Enables deterministic telemetry attribution and later cost reconciliation."}]}],"id":"blk-33548","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33550","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38069","text":"5.2 Negative consequences / tradeoffs"}]},{"id":"blk-33551","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38070","text":"More schema and records (deployments grow over time)."}]}],"id":"blk-33552","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38071","text":"Requires retention policy decisions for old deployments (storage cleanup, provider resource deprovisioning)."}]}],"id":"blk-33554","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38072","text":"Requires careful handling of “deploy succeeded but DB update failed” and vice versa."}]}],"id":"blk-33556","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33559","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38073","text":"Requires a versioning strategy (monotonic per agent) and concurrency controls."}]}],"id":"blk-33558","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33560","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38074","text":"6) Implementation details (normative requirements)"}]},{"id":"blk-33561","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38075","text":"6.1 Data model requirements"}]},{"id":"blk-33562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38076","text":"The following fields/semantics MUST exist (names may vary if consistent):"}]},{"id":"blk-33563","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38077","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-38078","text":" table with:"}]}],"id":"blk-33564","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38079","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"},{"id":"spn-38080","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38081","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"}]}],"id":"blk-33566","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33569","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38082","marks":["code"],"text":"version"},{"id":"spn-38083","text":" (monotonic per agent)"}]}],"id":"blk-33568","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38084","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"}]}],"id":"blk-33570","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33573","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38085","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact"},{"id":"spn-38086","text":" reference (uploaded bundle or repo ref)"}]}],"id":"blk-33572","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33575","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38087","marks":["code"],"text":"providerRef"},{"id":"spn-38088","text":" (runtime-specific invoke reference)"}]}],"id":"blk-33574","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33577","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38089","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-38090","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-38091","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"}]}],"id":"blk-33576","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38092","text":"timestamps ("},{"id":"spn-38093","marks":["code"],"text":"createdAtMs"},{"id":"spn-38094","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38095","marks":["code"],"text":"deployedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-38096","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38097","marks":["code"],"text":"finishedAtMs"},{"id":"spn-38098","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-33578","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38099","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38100","text":" pointer to "},{"id":"spn-38101","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments._id"},{"id":"spn-38102","text":" (nullable)"}]}],"id":"blk-33580","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33582","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38103","text":"6.2 Immutability enforcement"}]},{"id":"blk-33583","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38104","text":"Server code MUST NOT update artifact identity fields on "},{"id":"spn-38105","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments"},{"id":"spn-38106","text":" after creation:"}]}],"id":"blk-33584","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33587","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38107","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact.*"},{"id":"spn-38108","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38109","marks":["code"],"text":"manifest.*"},{"id":"spn-38110","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38111","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-38112","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38113","marks":["code"],"text":"version"}]}],"id":"blk-33586","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38114","text":"Only the allowed mutable subset may be updated (status/providerRef/error/timestamps/log pointers)."}]}],"id":"blk-33588","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38115","text":"Client code MUST NOT be allowed to update deployment rows directly."}]}],"id":"blk-33590","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33592","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38116","text":"6.3 Activation rules"}]},{"id":"blk-33593","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38117","text":"When activating a deployment (including rollback):"}]},{"id":"blk-33594","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33596","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38118","text":"The target deployment MUST:"}]}],"id":"blk-33595","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33598","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38119","text":"belong to the agent,"}]}],"id":"blk-33597","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38120","text":"belong to the current user (tenant check),"}]}],"id":"blk-33599","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38121","text":"be in a valid state for activation (recommended: "},{"id":"spn-38122","marks":["code"],"text":"status=active"},{"id":"spn-38123","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-33601","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38124","text":"The system MUST update "},{"id":"spn-38125","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38126","text":" to the target deployment id."}]}],"id":"blk-33603","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33606","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38127","text":"The system SHOULD record an audit log entry:"}]}],"id":"blk-33605","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33608","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38128","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.activate"},{"id":"spn-38129","text":" with "},{"id":"spn-38130","marks":["code"],"text":"{agentId, deploymentId}"},{"id":"spn-38131","text":" and optional reason."}]}],"id":"blk-33607","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33609","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38132","text":"6.4 Routing rules"}]},{"id":"blk-33610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38133","text":"The invocation gateway MUST route using: 1. resolve agent and enforce ownership (unless public agents exist post-v1), 2. verify agent is not "},{"id":"spn-38134","marks":["code"],"text":"disabled"},{"id":"spn-38135","text":"/deleted, 3. read "},{"id":"spn-38136","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38137","text":", 4. load deployment by id and verify it belongs to agent and user, 5. route via runtime adapter selected by "},{"id":"spn-38138","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-38139","text":", 6. invoke using "},{"id":"spn-38140","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment.providerRef"},{"id":"spn-38141","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-33611","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38142","text":"Routing MUST NOT use “latest deployment” heuristics."}]},{"id":"blk-33612","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38143","text":"6.5 Deploy flow atomicity and failure handling"}]},{"id":"blk-33613","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38144","text":"A deployment flow typically spans multiple systems (DB + provider). The platform MUST handle partial failures."}]},{"id":"blk-33614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38145","text":"Minimum v1 requirement:"}]},{"id":"blk-33615","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33617","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38146","text":"The system MUST persist a deployment row with "},{"id":"spn-38147","marks":["code"],"text":"status=deploying"},{"id":"spn-38148","text":" before making provider calls."}]}],"id":"blk-33616","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33619","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38149","text":"If provider deployment fails:"}]}],"id":"blk-33618","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38150","text":"set deployment "},{"id":"spn-38151","marks":["code"],"text":"status=failed"},{"id":"spn-38152","text":" and store sanitized "},{"id":"spn-38153","marks":["code"],"text":"errorMessage"},{"id":"spn-38154","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33620","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38155","text":"set agent "},{"id":"spn-38156","marks":["code"],"text":"status=error"},{"id":"spn-38157","text":" (or keep existing status but expose failure)."}]}],"id":"blk-33622","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33625","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38158","text":"If provider deployment succeeds but DB update fails:"}]}],"id":"blk-33624","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38159","text":"the system MUST have a retry mechanism (manual or automated) to reconcile:"}]}],"id":"blk-33626","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33629","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38160","text":"either re-run the “finalize deploy” step idempotently, or"}]}],"id":"blk-33628","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33631","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38161","text":"detect orphaned provider resources via tags and mark deployment active later."}]}],"id":"blk-33630","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33633","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38162","text":"If DB update succeeds but provider deployment later fails (rare but possible due to eventual consistency):"}]}],"id":"blk-33632","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33635","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38163","text":"system must reconcile on next healthcheck/invoke attempt and mark deployment failed if unusable."}]}],"id":"blk-33634","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33636","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38164","text":"6.6 Provider resource tagging (required for cleanup and reconciliation)"}]},{"id":"blk-33637","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38165","text":"All provider resources created for a deployment MUST be tagged/labelled with:"}]},{"id":"blk-33638","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33640","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38166","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"}]}],"id":"blk-33639","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38167","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33641","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33644","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38168","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33643","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33646","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38169","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentVersion"}]}],"id":"blk-33645","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38170","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"}]}],"id":"blk-33647","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33649","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38171","text":"6.7 Retention and cleanup"}]},{"id":"blk-33650","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38172","text":"Deployments are retained as part of audit history."}]}],"id":"blk-33651","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33654","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38173","text":"The platform SHOULD implement:"}]}],"id":"blk-33653","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33656","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38174","text":"retention policy for old deployments (e.g., keep last N or last X days) per tier,"}]}],"id":"blk-33655","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33658","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38175","text":"best-effort deprovisioning of provider resources when deployments are deleted or when an agent is deleted."}]}],"id":"blk-33657","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38176","text":"Cleanup MUST be careful not to remove resources for the currently active deployment."}]}],"id":"blk-33659","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33661","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38177","text":"7) Testing requirements (acceptance-focused)"}]},{"id":"blk-33662","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38178","text":"7.1 Unit tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-33663","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38179","text":"Deployment status transition validation."}]}],"id":"blk-33664","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33667","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38180","text":"Immutability enforcement (attempted mutation of immutable fields rejected)."}]}],"id":"blk-33666","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38181","text":"Activation validation (wrong agent/user/state rejected)."}]}],"id":"blk-33668","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38182","text":"Routing resolver uses "},{"id":"spn-38183","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38184","text":" only."}]}],"id":"blk-33670","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33672","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38185","text":"7.2 Integration tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-33673","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33675","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38186","text":"Deploy creates new immutable record; a second deploy creates a second record."}]}],"id":"blk-33674","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33677","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38187","text":"Activate (rollback) changes routing immediately."}]}],"id":"blk-33676","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33679","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38188","text":"Concurrent deploy attempts are rejected with "},{"id":"spn-38189","marks":["code"],"text":"CONFLICT"},{"id":"spn-38190","text":" (v1)."}]}],"id":"blk-33678","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33681","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38191","text":"Telemetry attribution includes correct "},{"id":"spn-38192","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38193","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33680","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33682","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38194","text":"7.3 E2E tests (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-33683","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33685","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38195","text":"Deploy v1 → invoke returns v1 output."}]}],"id":"blk-33684","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33687","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38196","text":"Deploy v2 → invoke returns v2 output."}]}],"id":"blk-33686","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33689","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38197","text":"Activate v1 → invoke returns v1 output again."}]}],"id":"blk-33688","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33691","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38198","text":"Deployment history remains intact and visible."}]}],"id":"blk-33690","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33692","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38199","text":"8) Future extensions enabled by this ADR"}]},{"id":"blk-33693","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38200","text":"This model is a foundation for:"}]},{"id":"blk-33694","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33696","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38201","text":"canary/blue-green deployments (multiple “active” pointers with traffic split policies),"}]}],"id":"blk-33695","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33698","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38202","text":"environment promotion (dev → staging → prod) with deployment immutability preserved,"}]}],"id":"blk-33697","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33700","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38203","text":"signed deployment manifests / provenance,"}]}],"id":"blk-33699","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33702","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38204","text":"provider billing reconciliation (resource tags + immutable providerRef),"}]}],"id":"blk-33701","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33704","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38205","text":"more advanced rollback policies (automatic rollback on error rate thresholds)."}]}],"id":"blk-33703","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33705","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38206","text":"9) Acceptance criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-33706","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38207","text":"This ADR is correctly implemented when: 1. Every deployment attempt creates a new deployment record and does not mutate previous deployments’ immutable fields. 2. An agent’s invocations always route to "},{"id":"spn-38208","marks":["code"],"text":"activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-38209","text":" (no “latest deploy” routing). 3. Rollback is implemented as an activation/pointer update and takes effect immediately for new invocations. 4. Deployment status transitions are correct and failures do not corrupt the active deployment pointer. 5. Provider resources are tagged with "},{"id":"spn-38210","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId}"},{"id":"spn-38211","text":". 6. E2E tests demonstrate deploy v1 → deploy v2 → rollback to v1 with correct outputs and preserved history."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierawrwn6dy6mfwehc5nxk22jgayeth5n55wszz3gjptfr45jmpphh7q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}